Marketing approval of our product candidates in international markets will subject us to additional costs and a variety of risks associated with
international operations.
We intend to pursue marketing approvals for our product candidates in international markets directly or with partners and will be subject to additional
costs and additional risks related to international operations, including:
• different regulatory requirements for drug approvals in foreign countries;
• reduced protection for intellectual property rights;
• unexpected changes in tariffs, trade barriers and regulatory requirements;
